{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18124","headline":"送诸葛觉往随州读书 · 韩愈","name":"送诸葛觉往随州读书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"邺侯家多书，插架三万轴。\n一一悬牙签，新若手未触。\n爲人强记览，过眼不再读。\n伟哉羣圣文，磊落载其腹。\n行年五十余，出守数已六。\n京邑有旧庐，不容久食宿。\n台阁多官员，无地寄一足。\n我虽官在朝，气势日局缩。\n屡爲丞相言，虽恳不见录。\n送行过滻水，东望不转目。\n今子从之游，学问得所欲。\n入海观龙鱼，矫翮逐黄鹄。\n勉爲新诗章，月寄三四幅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18124.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18124","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}